# Ignore docs/* but keep migration runbooks (rollback procedures, backup notes).
# `docs/*` (not bare `docs`) is required so that the negation below can
# re-include specific subdirectories. Negation cannot escape a wholly-ignored
# parent directory.
docs/*
!docs/migrations/
!docs/migrations/**
